### ============================================
### Global Dependencies - Header Validation
### ============================================

### 1. GET items - valid headers
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token
X-Key: fake-super-secret-key

###

### 2. GET users - valid headers
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token
X-Key: fake-super-secret-key

###

### ============================================
### Error Cases
### ============================================

### 3. GET items - missing headers (expect 422)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/

###

### 4. GET items - invalid headers (expect 400)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
X-Token: invalid-token
X-Key: invalid-key